# Build context of backend/Dockerfile: an allowlist of what the image copies. Everything else stays
# out: the virtual environment, tests, caches, the dev e-mail outbox (var/) and above all any .env
# file (the image takes its configuration from the environment only).
*
!requirements.txt
!alembic.ini
!alembic/
!app/

# Never, even inside the allowed folders.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
